  "description": "An embeddable holographic SQL database for .NET: transactional (ACID with a write-ahead log), columnar storage with compiled predicates, holo-native aggregates, and hash joins, with an optional memory-mapped larger-than-memory tier. Integrates as an EvalApp extension — attach it to a pipeline and query it from a step — with async execution. Built on the Phasor VSA codec.",
